[p125]     4.24.    BUILD-024 Builder Output
[p125] 
[p125] 
[p125] The final output of the Pricing Builder is structured pricing work that can be consumed
[p125] consistently by subsequent MVP capabilities.
[p125] 
[p125] Where applicable, the Builder output must preserve:
[p125] 
[p125]    ● pricing action;
[p125]    ● affected pricing scope;
[p125]    ● relevant pricing baseline;
[p125]    ● structured pricing logic;
[p125]    ● calculation inputs;
[p125]    ● explicit assumptions;
[p125]    ● material parameters;
[p125]    ● conditions;
[p125]    ● constraints;
[p125]    ● references to applicable organisational Guardrails and, where available, their
[p125]        authoritative ANALYSIS-014 evaluation results;
[p125]    ● exceptions;
[p125]    ● deterministic calculation status;
[p125]    ● applicable calculation method;
[p125]    ● resulting proposed pricing output;
[p125]    ● distinction between system-calculated values and manually determined or qualitative
[p125]        components.
[p125] 
[p126] Organisational Guardrail references contained in Builder output must point to the applicable
