[p126] 
[p126] Where an ANALYSIS-014 evaluation is not yet available, the Builder output may preserve
[p126] the applicable Guardrail reference without inventing an evaluation result.
[p126] 
[p126] For deterministically calculable pricing work, the Builder output must contain sufficient
[p126] information for the analytical layer to reproduce the result using the calculation definitions in
